    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d871">

                <pb facs="0792" n="620" sameAs="frus:frus1917Supp01v01/pg620"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 705.6358/8</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Swedish Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Ekengren</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Department of Austro-</seg>
                    <lb/>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">Hungarian Interests</seg>
                </opener>
                <p>The Minister of Sweden, representing Austro-Hungarian interests in the United
                    States, presents his compliments to his excellency the Secretary of State and
                    has the honor to inform him that Austro-Hungarian <pb facs="0793" n="621"
                        xml:id="pg621"/> interests in the Hawaiian Islands, which until recently
                    have been in charge of the Spanish Consul at Honolulu who has left, have been
                    transferred to the Royal Swedish Consulate at San Francisco, Calif.</p>
                <p>The Minister of Sweden, therefore, begs to request his excellency the Secretary
                    of State to kindly inform the competent authorities of the new jurisdiction of
                    the Swedish Consulate in San Francisco.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1917-10-29"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">October 29, 1917</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received October 31.</hi>]</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
